description.desc:
Upon entering the battlefield, if the character has less than 60 Energy, recover Energy to 60. In Investigation Zone Mode, this effect can trigger once every 180s;
With enough Energy, press <IconMap:Icon_SpecialReady> to activate:
Unleash a powerful attack across a large area ahead, dealing <color=#FFA9DD>Lumiflux DMG</color>;
After the skill ends, apply 2 <color=#FFA9DD>[Lumiflux Buildup]</color> to all enemies hit;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

When Remielle is in-combat and <color=#FFFFFF>[Floating Radiance]</color> reaches its maximum of 120, hold <IconMap:Icon_Special> after a <color=#FFFFFF>[Special Attack]</color> or <color=#FFFFFF>[EX Special Attack]</color> to enter <color=#FFFFFF>[Stance Shift]</color>. Switching Characters while in <color=#FFFFFF>[Stance Shift]</color> enters the <color=#FFFFFF>[Phase Flow]</color> state:
While in the <color=#FFFFFF>[Phase Flow]</color> state, Remielle acts autonomously to assist in combat. Some attacks also apply <color=#FFA9DD>[Lumiflux Buildup]</color> to the target. <color=#FFFFFF>[Floating Radiance]</color> is consumed over time while in the <color=#FFFFFF>[Phase Flow]</color> state. When <color=#FFFFFF>[Floating Radiance]</color> is depleted or Remielle leaves the in-combat state, she exits the <color=#FFFFFF>[Phase Flow]</color> state. Before exiting the <color=#FFFFFF>[Phase Flow]</color> state, Remielle cannot be switched in except via a <color=#FFFFFF>[Chain Attack]</color>;
If Remielle triggers 3 <Term:1000031></Term> reactions while in the <color=#FFFFFF>[Phase Flow]</color> state, or has at least 1 stored <Term:1000033></Term> when <color=#FFFFFF>[Floating Radiance]</color> is depleted, <color=#FFFFFF>[Assist: Flower & Feather Dance]</color> is activated, unlocking normal switch-ins and automatically triggering <color=#FFFFFF>[Assist: Flower & Feather Dance]</color> on Remielle's next normal switch-in;
Upon entering the <color=#FFFFFF>[Phase Flow]</color> state, all squad members' DMG dealt is increased by <color=#2BAD00>{CAL:0+AvatarSkillLevel(1)*1.5,1,2}%</color> for 60s. Repeated triggers reset the duration;
If Remielle uses a <color=#FFFFFF>[Special Attack]</color> or <color=#FFFFFF>[EX Special Attack]</color> that hits a Stunned enemy and <color=#FFFFFF>[Floating Radiance]</color> has reached its maximum of 120, switching Characters during the <color=#FFFFFF>[Special Attack]</color> or <color=#FFFFFF>[EX Special Attack]</color> also enters the <color=#FFFFFF>[Phase Flow]</color> state;
If no character is switched in after entering <color=#FFFFFF>[Stance Shift]</color>, Remielle uses a downward attack to return to the ground.
